%% @type flowchart
%% @level system
flowchart TD
    E[Error observed] --> Cl&#123;Class&#125;
    Cl -->|Transient HTTP| R[Retry / rate limit / CB]
    Cl -->|Permanent HTTP| F[Fail batch / surface error]
    Cl -->|Schema/DQ| Q[Quarantine + metrics]
    Cl -->|Config| C[Fail fast config error]
    R --> E2{Exhausted?}
    E2 -->|No| Retry[Retry attempt]
    Retry --> E
    E2 -->|Yes| F
    Q --> Ops[Operator inspect / replay]
    F --> Lock[Release lock / cleanup ADR-015]
